{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100619","id":2245609211,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6F2Ub7","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100619","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100619.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100619.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100619","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100619/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100619/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100619/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/015a3b043413e36644d48a249ecd379e9a271cc3","number":100619,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Optimize / refactor `CowData`, combining resize and fork to avoid unnecessary reallocations.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR optimizes `CowData` `resize` operations. This affects all non-trivial resizes for `String` and `Vector` (e.g. `Packed` arrays), including concatenation.\n\nThis PR is also a stepping stone for `Vector` `reserve` functionality, which will be a lot easier to implement after this refactor.\r\n\r\n~This PR includes #100694, because without it, leaks are occurring due to cyclic references that the previous implementation luckily avoided through unnecessary forking.~\r\nThis PR also supersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100672.\r\n\r\n## Reasoning\r\nThe current implementation of `resize` first forks if there are multiple owners, and then resizes the freshly forked array.\r\nIn the case that the needed array is larger than the previous array, time is wasted because a new location may have to be found for the larger buffer on the subsequent `realloc`, and the data has to be copied over again.\r\nIn the case that the needed array is smaller than the previous array, time is wasted looking for a larger buffer than necessary, and constructing (and subsequently destructing) more elements than necessary.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\nI've benchmarked plain String concatenation through `+`, which can be 1.6x as fast as before. The PR is likely to affect and optimize many more functions involving `String` or `Vector`. \r\n\r\n```c++\r\n\tString s1 = \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\";\r\n\tString s2 = \"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.\";\r\n\r\n\tauto t0 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < 10000000; i ++) {\r\n\t\t// Test\r\n\t\tString s3 = s1 + s2;\r\n\t}\r\n\tauto t1 = std::chrono::high_resolution_clock::now();\r\n\tstd::cout << std::chrono::duration_cast<std::chrono::milliseconds>(t1 - t0).count() << \"ms\\n\";\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis yields:\r\n- `1349ms` on `master` (8483d794ffec51a22d9dc8872cc082f9f0ece9db / ba2c5c1e6196b774d55baa45de54aab530db08e9)\r\n- `825ms` on this PR (77d8900235a8b0fe7e3b597d4f664533f60ee82e)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id